Now I unpack my things.
I have a box of books.
They are my books from Mexico.
I open the box.
I take out a book.
And another book.
I put them on the shelf, one by one.
Soon the shelf is full.
Now all the books stand on the shelf.
I look at my bookshelf.
It looks nice.
They are my books in my home.
The flat feels different now.
It feels like mine.
